                        <h3>⚡ What is Auto Real Trading?</h3>
                        <p>
                            <strong>Auto Real Trading</strong> connects your QuantEdge algorithm directly to your <strong>Zerodha Demat and Trading account</strong>. Instead of paper simulation, the bot automatically buys and sells real shares on the National Stock Exchange (NSE) using your <strong>real cash balance</strong>.
                        </p>

