                            </div>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6;">
                                • Every order placed by the bot is a genuine order executed on the exchange through Zerodha.<br />
                                • Real profits are deposited directly into your Demat account, and real losses affect your Demat balance.<br />
                                • We strongly recommend running <strong>Auto Paper Trading</strong> for at least 1-2 weeks first until you are fully confident with the strategy!
                            </p>
                        </div>
