                        <h3>🔑 3 Simple Steps to Start (Takes 2 Minutes)</h3>
                        <p>Before the bot can place real trades on your behalf, complete these 3 simple checks:</p>

                        <!-- Step 1 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">1</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">Connect Zerodha Every Morning (1-Click Login)</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    Indian stock market regulations (SEBI) require a fresh login token every morning. Simply click <strong>"⚡ Connect Zerodha"</strong> in the top header once between <strong>08:30 AM and 09:15 AM</strong>. Once connected, the token stays active for the entire trading day.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 2 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">2</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">One-Time DDPI Activation (Free & Online)</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    <strong>DDPI</strong> (Demat Debit and Pledge Instruction) gives Zerodha permission to automatically sell shares when your target is reached — <strong>without asking you to enter a CDSL TPIN / OTP manually every single day</strong>.<br />
                                    • You only need to do this <strong>once</strong> via Zerodha Console with Aadhaar OTP eSign.<br />
                                    • Click the <strong>"📖 DDPI Guide"</strong> button on the dashboard for quick instructions.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 3 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">3</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">Ensure Available Cash in Zerodha</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    Make sure your Zerodha equity account has sufficient unencumbered cash balance. For example, if your trade budget is set to ₹20,000 per trade and max trades is 3, having ₹60,000 ensures all trades can be taken smoothly.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
