                    <div class="qe-ref-section">
                        <h3>🎯 Background Conditions Required to Place a Live Broker Order</h3>
                        <p>
                            Because real money is on the line, the bot enforces a strict <strong>3-tier validation architecture</strong> before sending a single buy order to Zerodha KiteConnect.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Tier 1: Gatekeeper Rules -->
                        <h4 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 18px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <span>🛡️ TIER 1: 3 Mandatory Market Filters (Zero-Tolerance)</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            If any of these 3 conditions fail, the stock is <strong>immediately REJECTED</strong>. No trade is taken:
                        </p>

                        <div class="guide-def-grid" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #34d399;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #34d399;">✅ 1. NIFTY Market Filter (Bullish Market)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">
                                    Nifty 50 Close must be above its 50-day average, and 20 EMA &gt; 50 EMA. If the market is crashing or in defensive mode, all buy orders are paused.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #38bdf8;">✅ 2. Stock Upward Trend (Price &gt; 20 EMA &gt; 50 EMA)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">
                                    The stock must be trading above its 20 and 50-day moving averages with upward slopes. We only trade stocks already going UP.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #a78bfa;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #a78bfa;">✅ 3. Trend Strength (ADX &ge; 20.0)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">
                                    Filters out choppy, flat stocks. The stock must demonstrate strong directional buying momentum.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Tier 2: 8-Factor Quality Matrix -->
                        <h4 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 22px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <span>⭐ TIER 2: 8-Factor Quality Scoring Matrix (Score &ge; 70 or 10/11 Match)</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                            A live BUY signal is generated only when the stock accumulates <strong>&ge; 70 Points out of 100</strong> across these technical factors:
                        </p>

                        <div class="guide-example-box" style="margin: 10px 0 20px 0; padding: 14px;">
                            <table class="guide-compare-table" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px;">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Factor</th>
                                        <th>Condition</th>
                                        <th>Weight</th>
                                        <th>Safety Purpose</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>4. Breakout Group</strong></td>
                                        <td>Breaks Prev Day High, 2-Week High, or 52W High</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+20 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Price is breaking out into fresh highs with no overhead sellers.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>5. Heavy Volume Surge</strong></td>
                                        <td>15m Volume &ge; 1.5x to 2.5x 20-candle average</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+15 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Confirms institutional buying backing the price move.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>6. Relative Strength</strong></td>
                                        <td>Stock 1M/3M Return &gt; NIFTY 50 Return</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+15 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Selects top performers that lead the broader stock market.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>7. Hourly Multi-Timeframe</strong></td>
                                        <td>60-minute Hourly Close &gt; EMA20</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+15 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Ensures both short-term (15m) and long-term (1h/1d) trends agree.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>8. RSI Momentum</strong></td>
                                        <td>15m RSI between 50 and 75 (Sweet spot: 55-70)</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+10 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Good upside speed without being extremely overextended.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>9. MACD Bullish</strong></td>
                                        <td>MACD Line &gt; Signal Line</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+10 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Positive momentum acceleration.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>10. Bullish Candle</strong></td>
                                        <td>15m candle close near high or &gt; 1.2x ATR</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+8 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Strong buying conviction right into the candle close.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>11. Risk : Reward Ratio</strong></td>
                                        <td>Target (2x ATR) vs Stop Loss (1.5x ATR) &ge; 1:2.0</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+7 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Ensures potential profit is at least twice the potential stop loss.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Tier 3: Zerodha Broker Pre-Flight Checks -->
                        <h4 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 22px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
