                                <p class="guide-def-text">Admin master switch must be active.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">⏰ 4. Market Hours (09:15 – 03:30)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Orders are only placed during regular NSE equity trading hours.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🛑 5. Max Daily Limit (e.g. 5 Trades)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Prevents overtrading. Caps real trades strictly at your configured daily limit.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">💵 6. Zerodha Cash Balance Check</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Confirms your Zerodha Demat account has enough free cash to buy the shares.</p>
                            </div>
