                        <h3>🛡️ How Your Money is Protected</h3>
                        <p>Trading with real money requires rock-solid risk boundaries. The engine includes 4 layers of safety protections:</p>

                        <div class="guide-def-grid">
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">💰 Fixed Budget Per Trade</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">The bot never puts all your money into one stock. If you set ₹20,000 per trade, it will only buy up to ₹20,000 worth of shares per company.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🛑 Daily Trade Cap (Speed Limit)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Configured with a maximum limit (e.g. 5 trades per day). Even if the market gives 20 buy signals, the bot stops after 5 trades to avoid overtrading.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #f87171;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🛡️ Automated Stop Loss Protection</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Every position is watched constantly. If a stock falls by <strong>-3%</strong>, the bot automatically cuts the trade so you never suffer a catastrophic loss.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #ef4444; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08);">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #f87171;">🚨 Emergency Panic Kill Switch</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Located right in the top bar. If you feel uncomfortable, see extreme market volatility, or want to exit, clicking this button immediately pauses the bot and safely exits open orders.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
